accTitle: "NutsNews iOS — Feature 1: Saved Stories Library"
accDescr: "This update adds one native App Store Review feature only: a local Saved Stories Library."
flowchart TD
  A[User views story in feed] --> B[Tap heart on story card]
  B --> C[Create or update SavedStory entry in UserDefaults]
  C --> D[Persist full story payload]
  A2[User opens Saved tab] --> E[Load saved stories from local storage]
  E --> F[Search/filter by title, summary, source, category]
  F --> G[Display saved items with date and count]
  G --> H[Tap saved item to open article detail]
  I[User removes saved story] --> J[Delete story from local store]
  J --> K[Update saved list and count]

